# Planning Doc Rules

Read `.agents/planning.md` before editing planning files.

- PRD and ADD = current scope only; no V2/roadmap language
- Deferred features → `Planning/FUTURE.md`, not PRD
- IMPLEMENTATION = developer execution guide; update when PRD changes
- TESTING = verification strategy; keep AC-WP-* IDs in sync with PRD §7
